      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::web::004::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging at 1150–1180°C for an optimized duration in an inert atmosphere will induce fine, coherent γ′ precipitates.",
